    "detailed_description": "Starbreed<br><br>Starbreed is a 18+ 3D Rail-Shooter. Battle through each level to unlock party members to romance, upgrade your ship, and unlock fully animated H-content.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2694020/extras/a7df8972dd7089c0413f10c680e7e533.poster.avif?t=1716235132\" width=496 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2694020/extras/a7df8972dd7089c0413f10c680e7e533.webm?t=1716235132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2694020/extras/a7df8972dd7089c0413f10c680e7e533.mp4?t=1716235132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Starbreed is inspired by classic 3D rail shooters with a dating sim twist. Each ally you unlock comes with a passive and active ability to add to your kit. Bring them in your party to raise their affinity, and unlock Hscenes with them.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2694020/extras/11fce5dc00052fa3c236c9eaa3fff037.poster.avif?t=1716235132\" width=414 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2694020/extras/11fce5dc00052fa3c236c9eaa3fff037.webm?t=1716235132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2694020/extras/11fce5dc00052fa3c236c9eaa3fff037.mp4?t=1716235132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Experiment with combinations of party members, and weapon types to find the style you enjoy the most!<br><br>Completing levels will reward you with &quot;Credits&quot;. With these you can purchase new weapon types, upgrades, and pinups, and more!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"